<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Client Portal Flow Map</title>
<style>
:root{--bg:#e7eaed;--ink:#262b2f;--mut:#68727a;--card:#fff;--line:#d5dbe0;--hl:#e8ff3b;--ar:#3e5669}
@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){:root:not([data-theme=light]){--bg:#171b1e;--ink:#e8ecef;--mut:#98a3ab;--card:#22282c;--line:#343c42;--hl:#d6f01f;--ar:#9db8cb}}
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:14px/1.45 "DM Sans",system-ui,sans-serif}
header{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:5;background:var(--bg);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:12px 24px;display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap}
header h1{font-size:16px;margin:0 8px 0 0}header a{color:var(--ink);text-decoration:none;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;background:var(--hl);color:#262b2f;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:3px}
section{padding:28px 24px 8px}.sh{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}.sh h2{margin:0;font-size:18px}
.tag{background:var(--hl);color:#262b2f;font-weight:800;font-size:18px;padding:2px 8px;letter-spacing:.2px}
.note{margin:8px 0 14px;color:var(--mut);max-width:900px}
.row{display:flex;align-items:stretch;overflow-x:auto;padding:4px 4px 24px;gap:0}
.card{flex:0 0 620px;margin:0;background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column}
.num{position:absolute;top:8px;left:8px;z-index:2;background:#262b2f;color:#fff;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;border-radius:50%;width:22px;height:22px;display:grid;place-items:center}
.shot{height:470px;overflow:hidden;cursor:zoom-in;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:#f8fafb}.shot img{width:100%;display:block;image-rendering:auto}
figcaption{padding:12px 14px}h4{margin:0 0 4px;font-size:14px}figcaption p{margin:0;color:var(--mut);font-size:12.5px}
.arrow{flex:0 0 130px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:6px;color:var(--ar);padding:0 8px;text-align:center}
.arrow span{font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700;background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--ar);border-radius:6px;padding:4px 7px}.arrow svg{width:60px;height:12px}.arrow.end{flex-basis:24px}
#lb{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(0,0,0,.72);display:none;overflow:auto;z-index:20;padding:24px}#lb img{display:block;margin:0 auto;max-width:1440px;width:100%;border-radius:8px;background:#fff}
@media (max-width:640px){.card{flex-basis:300px}section{padding:20px 16px 4px}}
</style></head><body>
<header><h1>Cloud Club · Client portal flow map</h1><a href="#CLIENT-1.0">CLIENT – 1.0</a><a href="#CLIENT-2.0">CLIENT – 2.0</a><a href="#CLIENT-3.0">CLIENT – 3.0</a><a href="#CLIENT-4.0">CLIENT – 4.0</a><a href="#CLIENT-5.0">CLIENT – 5.0</a><a href="#CLIENT-6.0">CLIENT – 6.0</a></header>
<section id="CLIENT-1.0"><div class="sh"><span class="tag">CLIENT – 1.0</span><h2>First visit: a brand-new client lands on the portal (every tab)</h2></div><p class="note">New account (?new). No searches yet; sidebar shows sample interviews and a notification so the tabs are not empty to explore.</p><div class="row"><figure class="card"><div class="num">1</div><div class="shot" onclick="zoom(this)"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="flow-screens/01_1.0-first-visit_profile.png" alt="Profile (landing)"></div><figcaption><h4>Profile (landing)</h4><p>First screen after sign-in. Metrics are all 0. &#x27;Get started&#x27; checklist: 1 Complete company profile → Edit profile · 2 Create first job posting → Create a job posting · 3 Review matches · 4 Request interviews (steps 3–4 unlock after posting).</p></figcaption></figure><div class="arrow"><span>Click &#x27;Searches&#x27; in sidebar</span><svg viewBox="0 0 60 12"><path d="M0 6h54M48 1l6 5-6 5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div><figure class="card"><div class="num">2</div><div class="shot" onclick="zoom(this)"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="flow-screens/02_1.0-first-visit_searches.png" alt="Searches – empty"></div><figcaption><h4>Searches – empty</h4><p>No postings yet. Metric cards show 0 with hints. Monthly / Yearly switch changes the metric period. &#x27;Create a job posting&#x27; or &#x27;+ New job posting&#x27; starts section 2.0.</p></figcaption></figure><div class="arrow"><span>Click &#x27;Interviews&#x27;</span><svg viewBox="0 0 60 12"><path d="M0 6h54M48 1l6 5-6 5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div><figure class="card"><div class="num">3</div><div class="shot" onclick="zoom(this)"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="flow-screens/03_1.0-first-visit_interviews.png" alt="Interviews"></div><figcaption><h4>Interviews</h4><p>Sample interviews. Confirmed → Join interview / Copy link / View resume / Add interviewer. Awaiting → link and resume appear after the consultant accepts.</p></figcaption></figure><div class="arrow"><span>Click &#x27;Projects&#x27;</span><svg viewBox="0 0 60 12"><path d="M0 6h54M48 1l6 5-6 5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div><figure class="card"><div class="num">4</div><div class="shot" onclick="zoom(this)"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="flow-screens/04_1.0-first-visit_projects.png" alt="Projects"></div><figcaption><h4>Projects</h4><p>Active projects grouped by company; each opens consultant timesheets.</p></figcaption></figure><div class="arrow"><span>Click &#x27;Payments&#x27;</span><svg viewBox="0 0 60 12"><path d="M0 6h54M48 1l6 5-6 5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div><figure class="card"><div class="num">5</div><div class="shot" onclick="zoom(this)"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="flow-screens/05_1.0-first-visit_payments.png" alt="Payments"></div><figcaption><h4>Payments</h4><p>Payment summary with Monthly / Yearly switch and payments table (filter, page size, pagination).</p></figcaption></figure><div class="arrow"><span>Click &#x27;Referrals&#x27;</span><svg viewBox="0 0 60 12"><path d="M0 6h54M48 1l6 5-6 5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div><figure class="card"><div class="num">6</div><div class="shot" onclick="zoom(this)"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="flow-screens/06_1.0-first-visit_referrals.png" alt="Referrals"></div><figcaption><h4>Referrals</h4><p>One-time referral code (Copy code / New code) and invite-by-email. Each invite or code is added to the list as &#x27;Invited&#x27;.</p></figcaption></figure><div class="arrow"><span>Click &#x27;Settings&#x27;</span><svg viewBox="0 0 60 12"><path d="M0 6h54M48 1l6 5-6 5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div><figure class="card"><div class="num">7</div><div class="shot" onclick="zoom(this)"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="flow-screens/07_1.0-first-visit_settings.png" alt="Settings"></div><figcaption><h4>Settings</h4><p>Account details (role = Admin), notification preferences, sign out.</p></figcaption></figure><div class="arrow"><span>Click bell &#x27;Notifications&#x27;</span><svg viewBox="0 0 60 12"><path d="M0 6h54M48 1l6 5-6 5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div><figure class="card"><div class="num">8</div><div class="shot" onclick="zoom(this)"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="flow-screens/08_1.0-first-visit_notif.png" alt="Notifications popup"></div><figcaption><h4>Notifications popup</h4><p>Opens from sidebar bell. Click an item → marks read and jumps to the related tab. &#x27;Mark all read&#x27; clears the badge.</p></figcaption></figure><div class="arrow"><span>Click chat bubble (bottom right)</span><svg viewBox="0 0 60 12"><path d="M0 6h54M48 1l6 5-6 5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div><figure class="card"><div class="num">9</div><div class="shot" onclick="zoom(this)"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="flow-screens/09_1.0-first-visit_chat.png" alt="Skai chat bubble"></div><figcaption><h4>Skai chat bubble</h4><p>Floating Skai assistant available on every tab.</p></figcaption></figure><div class="arrow end"></div></div></section><section id="CLIENT-2.0"><div class="sh"><span class="tag">CLIENT – 2.0</span><h2>Starting a job posting: basics, then choose how to fill it</h2></div><p class="note">Triggered by &#x27;New Job Posting&#x27; (sidebar), &#x27;Create a job posting&#x27; (Searches / Profile checklist). A draft is saved automatically once name + role are entered.</p><div class="row"><figure class="card"><div class="num">10</div><div class="shot" onclick="zoom(this)"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="flow-screens/10_2.0-start-posting_intake.png" alt="Start a new job posting"></div><figcaption><h4>Start a new job posting</h4><p>Two required fields: Project name and Role.</p></figcaption></figure><div class="arrow"><span>Click &#x27;Continue&#x27; with empty fields</span><svg viewBox="0 0 60 12"><path d="M0 6h54M48 1l6 5-6 5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div><figure class="card"><div class="num">11</div><div class="shot" onclick="zoom(this)"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="flow-screens/11_2.0-start-posting_intake_err.png" alt="Validation"></div><figcaption><h4>Validation</h4><p>Empty required fields are highlighted red; focus jumps to the first one.</p></figcaption></figure><div class="arrow"><span>Fill both, click &#x27;Continue&#x27;</span><svg viewBox="0 0 60 12"><path d="M0 6h54M48 1l6 5-6 5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div><figure class="card"><div class="num">12</div><div class="shot" onclick="zoom(this)"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="flow-screens/12_2.0-start-posting_intake_method.png" alt="How would you like to fill in the job posting?"></div><figcaption><h4>How would you like to fill in the job posting?</h4><p>Draft saved to Searches (toast). Two cards: &#x27;Create with Skai&#x27; (recommended) and &#x27;Fill in the form manually&#x27;. &#x27;Edit project name or role&#x27; goes back one step.</p></figcaption></figure><div class="arrow"><span>Click &#x27;Create with Skai&#x27;</span><svg viewBox="0 0 60 12"><path d="M0 6h54M48 1l6 5-6 5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div><figure class="card"><div class="num">13</div><div class="shot" onclick="zoom(this)"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="flow-screens/13_2.0-start-posting_intake_skai.png" alt="How should Skai help you?"></div><figcaption><h4>How should Skai help you?</h4><p>Guided conversation (one question at a time, easiest) or Chat beside the form (5-step form on the left, Skai chat on the right). &#x27;Back&#x27; returns to fill-in options.</p></figcaption></figure><div class="arrow"><span>Pick a Skai mode → section 4.0 · or &#x27;Fill in the form manually&#x27; → section 3.0</span><svg viewBox="0 0 60 12"><path d="M0 6h54M48 1l6 5-6 5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div></div></section><section id="CLIENT-3.0"><div class="sh"><span class="tag">CLIENT – 3.0</span><h2>Manual job form: 5 steps, validation, post</h2></div><p class="note">&#x27;Fill in the form manually&#x27;. Every step has Cancel/Go back, Save &amp; exit (keeps draft in Searches) and Continue. Required fields are marked *.</p><div class="row"><figure class="card"><div class="num">14</div><div class="shot" onclick="zoom(this)"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="flow-screens/14_3.0-manual-form_step0.png" alt="Step 1 · Hiring urgency &amp; reason"></div><figcaption><h4>Step 1 · Hiring urgency &amp; reason</h4><p>Why are you hiring (dropdown) and how urgent (Immediately / Soon / Planning). &#x27;Create with Skai&#x27; banner switches to Skai at any time; &#x27;Schedule a call&#x27; offers help from a Cloud Club representative.</p></figcaption></figure><div class="arrow"><span>Click &#x27;Continue&#x27; empty</span><svg viewBox="0 0 60 12"><path d="M0 6h54M48 1l6 5-6 5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div><figure class="card"><div class="num">15</div><div class="shot" onclick="zoom(this)"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="flow-screens/15_3.0-manual-form_step0_err.png" alt="Step 1 · validation"></div><figcaption><h4>Step 1 · validation</h4><p>Required fields turn red with &#x27;This field is required&#x27;; the user cannot advance.</p></figcaption></figure><div class="arrow"><span>Fill fields, click &#x27;Continue&#x27;</span><svg viewBox="0 0 60 12"><path d="M0 6h54M48 1l6 5-6 5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div><figure class="card"><div class="num">16</div><div class="shot" onclick="zoom(this)"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="flow-screens/16_3.0-manual-form_filled0.png" alt="Step 1 · filled in"></div><figcaption><h4>Step 1 · filled in</h4><p>Reason and urgency selected. Left stepper shows progress; completed steps get a check.</p></figcaption></figure><div class="arrow"><span>Click &#x27;Continue&#x27;</span><svg viewBox="0 0 60 12"><path d="M0 6h54M48 1l6 5-6 5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div><figure class="card"><div class="num">17</div><div class="shot" onclick="zoom(this)"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="flow-screens/17_3.0-manual-form_filled1.png" alt="Step 2 · Job specifications"></div><figcaption><h4>Step 2 · Job specifications</h4><p>Resource type, hours per week, ideal start and end date (&#x27;Not sure yet&#x27; checkbox for the end date) and &#x27;Has the budget been approved?&#x27;. A budget amount field follows. The &#x27;Create with Skai&#x27; banner is on every step.</p></figcaption></figure><div class="arrow"><span>Click &#x27;Continue&#x27; empty</span><svg viewBox="0 0 60 12"><path d="M0 6h54M48 1l6 5-6 5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div><figure class="card"><div class="num">18</div><div class="shot" onclick="zoom(this)"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="flow-screens/18_3.0-manual-form_step1_err.png" alt="Step 2 · validation"></div><figcaption><h4>Step 2 · validation</h4><p>Missing required fields (dates, budget approval) are flagged in red and the user cannot continue.</p></figcaption></figure><div class="arrow"><span>Fill and &#x27;Continue&#x27;</span><svg viewBox="0 0 60 12"><path d="M0 6h54M48 1l6 5-6 5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div><figure class="card"><div class="num">19</div><div class="shot" onclick="zoom(this)"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="flow-screens/19_3.0-manual-form_filled2.png" alt="Step 3 · Skill set &amp; experience"></div><figcaption><h4>Step 3 · Skill set &amp; experience</h4><p>Seniority, products/platforms (multi-select) with importance per item (Must have / Preferred / Bonus), certifications, programming languages &amp; technical skills with importance, industry experience, organization type, extra notes (250 chars).</p></figcaption></figure><div class="arrow"><span>Click &#x27;Continue&#x27;</span><svg viewBox="0 0 60 12"><path d="M0 6h54M48 1l6 5-6 5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div><figure class="card"><div class="num">20</div><div class="shot" onclick="zoom(this)"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="flow-screens/20_3.0-manual-form_filled3.png" alt="Step 4 · Work location, environment &amp; availability"></div><figcaption><h4>Step 4 · Work location, environment &amp; availability</h4><p>Work location, preferred hiring regions, acceptable working time zones and meeting frequency (all required).</p></figcaption></figure><div class="arrow"><span>Click &#x27;Continue&#x27;</span><svg viewBox="0 0 60 12"><path d="M0 6h54M48 1l6 5-6 5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div><figure class="card"><div class="num">21</div><div class="shot" onclick="zoom(this)"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="flow-screens/21_3.0-manual-form_filled4.png" alt="Step 5 · Authority &amp; approval"></div><figcaption><h4>Step 5 · Authority &amp; approval</h4><p>Other stakeholders involved in the decision and who has final sign-off (both required). The last step&#x27;s button is &#x27;Post job &amp; search&#x27;.</p></figcaption></figure><div class="arrow"><span>Click &#x27;Post job &amp; search&#x27;</span><svg viewBox="0 0 60 12"><path d="M0 6h54M48 1l6 5-6 5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div><figure class="card"><div class="num">22</div><div class="shot" onclick="zoom(this)"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="flow-screens/22_3.0-manual-form_posting.png" alt="Posting… (matching animation)"></div><figcaption><h4>Posting… (matching animation)</h4><p>Loader cycles: Scoring skills → Checking availability → Weighing must-haves → Ranking top matches (~5 s). Job is saved as Posted; a project and offer are added.</p></figcaption></figure><div class="arrow"><span>Auto-advances</span><svg viewBox="0 0 60 12"><path d="M0 6h54M48 1l6 5-6 5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div><figure class="card"><div class="num">23</div><div class="shot" onclick="zoom(this)"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="flow-screens/23_3.0-manual-form_results.png" alt="Matched consultants"></div><figcaption><h4>Matched consultants</h4><p>Match cards with score ring, Top / Strong / Potential match, availability, filters (Now, ≤2 weeks, fit), Cards / Compare table, &#x27;View more&#x27;, &#x27;View Profile&#x27; and &#x27;Request interview&#x27;. Skai chat opens beside the list with quick prompts.</p></figcaption></figure><div class="arrow"><span>Click &#x27;Request interview&#x27; → section 5.0</span><svg viewBox="0 0 60 12"><path d="M0 6h54M48 1l6 5-6 5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div></div></section><section id="CLIENT-4.0"><div class="sh"><span class="tag">CLIENT – 4.0</span><h2>Create with Skai</h2></div><p class="note">Two Skai modes chosen on the method screen. Both write into the same job posting and can switch to the manual form.</p><div class="row"><figure class="card"><div class="num">24</div><div class="shot" onclick="zoom(this)"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="flow-screens/24_4.0-skai_guided.png" alt="Skai · guided conversation"></div><figcaption><h4>Skai · guided conversation</h4><p>Opens with &#x27;Describe the role in your own words&#x27; — Analyse my description, Use an example, or Skip and be asked questions one at a time. &#x27;0 of 9 details captured&#x27; progress bar, &#x27;View job summary&#x27;, &#x27;Back to searches&#x27;, then review and Post.</p></figcaption></figure><div class="arrow"><span>Finish review → Post → matching → results</span><svg viewBox="0 0 60 12"><path d="M0 6h54M48 1l6 5-6 5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div><figure class="card"><div class="num">25</div><div class="shot" onclick="zoom(this)"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="flow-screens/25_4.0-skai_split.png" alt="Skai · chat beside the form"></div><figcaption><h4>Skai · chat beside the form</h4><p>Five-step form on the left fills in live from the Skai chat on the right (paste a requirement, upload a JD/SOW, or tap a suggested prompt). Every field can still be edited by hand.</p></figcaption></figure><div class="arrow"><span>Complete → Continue → post</span><svg viewBox="0 0 60 12"><path d="M0 6h54M48 1l6 5-6 5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div></div></section><section id="CLIENT-5.0"><div class="sh"><span class="tag">CLIENT – 5.0</span><h2>From matches to interview invite</h2></div><p class="note">Click &#x27;Request interview&#x27; on a match card (or select several and invite together).</p><div class="row"><figure class="card"><div class="num">26</div><div class="shot" onclick="zoom(this)"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="flow-screens/26_5.0-interview-invite_cprofile.png" alt="Consultant profile"></div><figcaption><h4>Consultant profile</h4><p>Full profile of a matched consultant. &#x27;Back&#x27; returns to results; &#x27;Request interview&#x27; starts scheduling.</p></figcaption></figure><div class="arrow"><span>Click &#x27;Invite&#x27;</span><svg viewBox="0 0 60 12"><path d="M0 6h54M48 1l6 5-6 5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div><figure class="card"><div class="num">27</div><div class="shot" onclick="zoom(this)"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="flow-screens/27_5.0-interview-invite_sched0.png" alt="Schedule · step 1 of 2"></div><figcaption><h4>Schedule · step 1 of 2</h4><p>How many interviews, type, format (1:1 / small team / panel), optional extra interviewers. Right panel lists invited consultants and proposed dates.</p></figcaption></figure><div class="arrow"><span>Click &#x27;Continue&#x27; empty</span><svg viewBox="0 0 60 12"><path d="M0 6h54M48 1l6 5-6 5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div><figure class="card"><div class="num">28</div><div class="shot" onclick="zoom(this)"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="flow-screens/28_5.0-interview-invite_sched0err.png" alt="Schedule · validation"></div><figcaption><h4>Schedule · validation</h4><p>Required selections flagged. Step 2 asks for at least two business days per consultant and a time frame per date, plus time zone; Send invites then adds the interview to Interviews as &#x27;Awaiting&#x27;.</p></figcaption></figure><div class="arrow"><span>Fill → Continue → Send invites</span><svg viewBox="0 0 60 12"><path d="M0 6h54M48 1l6 5-6 5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div></div></section><section id="CLIENT-6.0"><div class="sh"><span class="tag">CLIENT – 6.0</span><h2>Returning client (account with data)</h2></div><p class="note">Same portal after the client has postings, interviews, projects and payments.</p><div class="row"><figure class="card"><div class="num">29</div><div class="shot" onclick="zoom(this)"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="flow-screens/29_6.0-returning-client_profile.png" alt="Profile"></div><figcaption><h4>Profile</h4><p>Metrics populated; completed checklist hides; profile cards (About, How you use Cloud Club…).</p></figcaption></figure><div class="arrow"><span>Click &#x27;Edit&#x27; on a card</span><svg viewBox="0 0 60 12"><path d="M0 6h54M48 1l6 5-6 5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div><figure class="card"><div class="num">30</div><div class="shot" onclick="zoom(this)"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="flow-screens/30_6.0-returning-client_profile_edit.png" alt="Profile · edit mode"></div><figcaption><h4>Profile · edit mode</h4><p>Card turns into a form. Save changes or Cancel (confirm-discard dialog).</p></figcaption></figure><div class="arrow"><span>Save / Cancel</span><svg viewBox="0 0 60 12"><path d="M0 6h54M48 1l6 5-6 5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div><figure class="card"><div class="num">31</div><div class="shot" onclick="zoom(this)"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="flow-screens/31_6.0-returning-client_searches.png" alt="Searches"></div><figcaption><h4>Searches</h4><p>Cards per posting: Draft / Posted. Actions: Edit title, Close / Reopen, Delete. Search box and Active / Closed / Deleted tabs.</p></figcaption></figure><div class="arrow"><span>Click a card</span><svg viewBox="0 0 60 12"><path d="M0 6h54M48 1l6 5-6 5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div><figure class="card"><div class="num">32</div><div class="shot" onclick="zoom(this)"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="flow-screens/32_6.0-returning-client_delmodal.png" alt="Delete confirmation"></div><figcaption><h4>Delete confirmation</h4><p>Asks before deleting. Posted jobs move to Deleted as read-only history; drafts are removed.</p></figcaption></figure><div class="arrow"><span>Click &#x27;Yes, delete&#x27;</span><svg viewBox="0 0 60 12"><path d="M0 6h54M48 1l6 5-6 5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div><figure class="card"><div class="num">33</div><div class="shot" onclick="zoom(this)"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="flow-screens/33_6.0-returning-client_deleted.png" alt="Searches · Deleted tab"></div><figcaption><h4>Searches · Deleted tab</h4><p>Deleted postings keep the full card layout but are disabled and styled in red.</p></figcaption></figure><div class="arrow end"></div><figure class="card"><div class="num">34</div><div class="shot" onclick="zoom(this)"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="flow-screens/34_6.0-returning-client_results.png" alt="Matched consultants"></div><figcaption><h4>Matched consultants</h4><p>Tabs: Consultants / Job posting. Invite one or many.</p></figcaption></figure><div class="arrow"><span>Click &#x27;Job posting&#x27; tab</span><svg viewBox="0 0 60 12"><path d="M0 6h54M48 1l6 5-6 5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div><figure class="card"><div class="num">35</div><div class="shot" onclick="zoom(this)"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="flow-screens/35_6.0-returning-client_jobtab.png" alt="Job posting tab"></div><figcaption><h4>Job posting tab</h4><p>The posted form answers, editable and bound to Skai chat answers (changes re-run matching).</p></figcaption></figure><div class="arrow end"></div><figure class="card"><div class="num">36</div><div class="shot" onclick="zoom(this)"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="flow-screens/36_6.0-returning-client_nomatch.png" alt="No matches · contact our team"></div><figcaption><h4>No matches · contact our team</h4><p>When no consultant fits: &#x27;Contact our team&#x27; form (urgency, channel, note). Send opens a confirmation email preview and notifies within 1–2 business days. &#x27;Notify me&#x27; emails when a match appears.</p></figcaption></figure><div class="arrow"><span>Click &#x27;Send request&#x27;</span><svg viewBox="0 0 60 12"><path d="M0 6h54M48 1l6 5-6 5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div><figure class="card"><div class="num">37</div><div class="shot" onclick="zoom(this)"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="flow-screens/37_6.0-returning-client_interviews.png" alt="Interviews"></div><figcaption><h4>Interviews</h4><p>Confirmed / Awaiting interviews with join link, interviewers and resume.</p></figcaption></figure><div class="arrow end"></div><figure class="card"><div class="num">38</div><div class="shot" onclick="zoom(this)"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="flow-screens/38_6.0-returning-client_projects.png" alt="Projects"></div><figcaption><h4>Projects</h4><p>Grouped by company. Open timesheets per consultant.</p></figcaption></figure><div class="arrow"><span>Click a project</span><svg viewBox="0 0 60 12"><path d="M0 6h54M48 1l6 5-6 5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div><figure class="card"><div class="num">39</div><div class="shot" onclick="zoom(this)"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="flow-screens/39_6.0-returning-client_timesheet.png" alt="Timesheet · Request changes"></div><figcaption><h4>Timesheet · Request changes</h4><p>Approve a week or &#x27;Request changes&#x27; with a required message; status becomes Rejected until the consultant resubmits.</p></figcaption></figure><div class="arrow"><span>Click &#x27;Send&#x27;</span><svg viewBox="0 0 60 12"><path d="M0 6h54M48 1l6 5-6 5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div><figure class="card"><div class="num">40</div><div class="shot" onclick="zoom(this)"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="flow-screens/40_6.0-returning-client_payments.png" alt="Payments"></div><figcaption><h4>Payments</h4><p>Totals plus payments table.</p></figcaption></figure><div class="arrow end"></div><figure class="card"><div class="num">41</div><div class="shot" onclick="zoom(this)"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="flow-screens/41_6.0-returning-client_referrals.png" alt="Referrals"></div><figcaption><h4>Referrals</h4><p>Codes and invites with statuses.</p></figcaption></figure><div class="arrow end"></div><figure class="card"><div class="num">42</div><div class="shot" onclick="zoom(this)"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="flow-screens/42_6.0-returning-client_settings.png" alt="Settings"></div><figcaption><h4>Settings</h4><p>Role = Admin; preferences; sign out.</p></figcaption></figure><div class="arrow end"></div></div></section>
<div id="lb" onclick="this.style.display='none'"><img id="lbi" alt=""></div>
<script>function zoom(e){document.getElementById('lbi').src=e.querySelector('img').src;document.getElementById('lb').style.display='block'}</script>
</body></html>